percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.8.dev 839de3dfd\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (839de3dfd) - Fedora Linux 44 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 610.43.03) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe **Move Node(s) Here** editor action can be used on non-movable nodes, such as Controls within a Container:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ef71c1d-50b1-4f29-8ff7-d22a3c27f634\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- In the MRP, select the first Button node, then right-click elsewhere (while still having the node selected) and choose **Move Node(s) Here**.\n- Save and reload the scene, and notice that the Button goes back to its original position, as it's not meant to be moved while in a Container.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_move_nodes_here.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30514288/test_move_nodes_here.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/e